    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Driftholt's crossing ground. The col here is the only one drawn on the island and the saddle beside it is one of two \u2014 the other stands on reported ground \u2014 so this is the only walked way between one coast and the other. A party comes over it for the grazing on either flank, for what the marsh yields at the edges, and for the cut platform, which is where this ground's stone is prised out."
  },
